      "writtenOn": "2022-02-15T02:48:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Maybe  sdk_version: \"none\"  and  system_modules: \"none\" ?\n\nI think this addresses *some* of the targets in the allowlist (like `core-all`)\n\nBut there are other libcore targets that depend on non empty system modules (as an example, `core-lambda-stubs` uses `core-all-system-modules`). We could add these system modules to an allowlist, but then we end up with a different allowlist.\n\n\n\u003e dependencies via  static_libs  are not relevant w.r.t NewApi checks ...\n\nAck, thanks for the explanation",
